  description: Toucan runs a taco truck on the beach, selling tacos and taquitos
    to passersby. His rather large beak gets in the way of making eye contact while
    taking orders, but it sure does help with mashing salsa and guacamole.
  offensiveAbility: Taco Toco Toca - Spike is immune to blocks and always breaks
    through (20s cooldown)
